     "answer": "x^2 + 10x + 25",
     "explanation": "a = x, b = 5: x^2 + 2·x·5 + 5^2 = x^2 + 10x + 25."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-01", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Expand (3y − 2)^2.",
     "options": ["9y^2 + 12y + 4", "9y^2 − 12y + 4", "9y^2 − 12y − 4", "3y^2 − 12y + 4"],
     "answer": "9y^2 − 12y + 4",
