     "answer": "x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1",
     "explanation": "Apply (a + b)^3 with a = x, b = 1: x^3 + 3x^2(1) + 3x(1)^2 + 1^3."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-05", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor 6x^2 + 9x.",
