     "answer": "3x(2x + 3)",
     "explanation": "HCF of 6x^2 and 9x is 3x; pull it out."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-05", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor 12a^2 b − 18ab^2.",
     "options": ["6(a^2 b − 3ab^2)", "6ab(2a − 3b)", "2ab(6a − 9b)", "3ab(4a − 6b)"],
     "answer": "6ab(2a − 3b)",
     "explanation": "HCF of 12a^2 b and 18ab^2 is 6ab; the leftover factors are 2a and −3b."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-05", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 5(x − 1) + 7(x − 1)^2.",
     "options": ["(x − 1)(5 + 7x)", "(x − 1)(7x − 2)", "(x − 1)(12)", "(x − 1)(5 − 7x)"],
     "answer": "(x − 1)(7x − 2)",
     "explanation": "Common factor (x − 1): 5 + 7(x − 1) = 5 + 7x − 7 = 7x − 2; so factor is (x − 1)(7x − 2)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-06", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor by regrouping: ax + ay + bx + by.",
     "options": ["(a + b)(x + y)", "(a − b)(x + y)", "(a + b)(x − y)", "(a + x)(b + y)"],
     "answer": "(a + b)(x + y)",
     "explanation": "Group: a(x + y) + b(x + y) = (a + b)(x + y)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-06", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor by regrouping: x^3 − 3x^2 + 4x − 12.",
     "options": ["(x − 3)(x^2 + 4)", "(x + 3)(x^2 − 4)", "(x − 4)(x^2 + 3)", "(x − 3)(x^2 − 4)"],
     "answer": "(x − 3)(x^2 + 4)",
     "explanation": "Group: x^2(x − 3) + 4(x − 3) = (x − 3)(x^2 + 4)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor x^2 + 5x + 6.",
     "options": ["(x + 1)(x + 6)", "(x + 2)(x + 3)", "(x − 2)(x − 3)", "(x + 1)(x + 5)"],
     "answer": "(x + 2)(x + 3)",
     "explanation": "Find p, q with p + q = 5 and pq = 6: (2, 3)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor x^2 − 7x + 12.",
     "options": ["(x − 3)(x − 4)", "(x − 2)(x − 6)", "(x − 1)(x − 12)", "(x + 3)(x − 4)"],
     "answer": "(x − 3)(x − 4)",
     "explanation": "Sum −7, product 12 → (−3, −4)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 3x^2 + 11x + 6 by splitting the middle term.",
     "options": ["(3x + 2)(x + 3)", "(3x + 6)(x + 1)", "(x + 2)(3x + 3)", "(3x − 2)(x − 3)"],
     "answer": "(3x + 2)(x + 3)",
     "explanation": "a·c = 18, sum 11 → (2, 9). Split: 3x^2 + 2x + 9x + 6 = x(3x + 2) + 3(3x + 2) = (3x + 2)(x + 3)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 2x^2 − 7x + 3.",
     "options": ["(2x − 1)(x − 3)", "(2x + 1)(x − 3)", "(2x − 3)(x − 1)", "(2x + 3)(x + 1)"],
     "answer": "(2x − 1)(x − 3)",
     "explanation": "a·c = 6, sum −7 → (−1, −6). Split: 2x^2 − x − 6x + 3 = x(2x − 1) − 3(2x − 1) = (2x − 1)(x − 3)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor x^2 + x − 12.",
     "options": ["(x + 4)(x − 3)", "(x − 4)(x + 3)", "(x + 6)(x − 2)", "(x − 6)(x + 2)"],
     "answer": "(x + 4)(x − 3)",
     "explanation": "Sum 1, product −12 → (4, −3)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 6x^2 + 7x − 3.",
     "options": ["(2x + 3)(3x − 1)", "(2x − 3)(3x + 1)", "(6x − 3)(x + 1)", "(2x + 1)(3x − 3)"],
     "answer": "(2x + 3)(3x − 1)",
     "explanation": "a·c = −18, sum 7 → (9, −2). Split: 6x^2 + 9x − 2x − 3 = 3x(2x + 3) − 1(2x + 3) = (2x + 3)(3x − 1)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "ANALYZE", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Which pattern factors x^2 − 49?",
     "options": ["Perfect square trinomial", "Difference of squares", "Sum of cubes", "Common factor only"],
     "answer": "Difference of squares",
     "explanation": "x^2 − 49 = x^2 − 7^2 = (x + 7)(x − 7)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor 49x^2 − 25.",
     "options": ["(7x + 5)(7x − 5)", "(7x + 5)^2", "(49x + 25)(x − 1)", "(7x − 5)^2"],
     "answer": "(7x + 5)(7x − 5)",
     "explanation": "(7x)^2 − 5^2 = (7x + 5)(7x − 5)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "ANALYZE", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 16a^4 − 81b^4 completely.",
     "options": ["(4a^2 − 9b^2)(4a^2 + 9b^2)", "(2a − 3b)(2a + 3b)(4a^2 + 9b^2)", "(4a − 9b)(4a + 9b)", "(2a − 3b)^4"],
     "answer": "(2a − 3b)(2a + 3b)(4a^2 + 9b^2)",
     "explanation": "Difference of squares twice: 16a^4 − 81b^4 = (4a^2 − 9b^2)(4a^2 + 9b^2) = (2a − 3b)(2a + 3b)(4a^2 + 9b^2)."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Factor x^2 + 12x + 36.",
     "options": ["(x + 6)^2", "(x + 12)^2", "(x + 6)(x − 6)", "(x − 6)^2"],
     "answer": "(x + 6)^2",
     "explanation": "x^2 + 2·6·x + 6^2 is a perfect square: (x + 6)^2."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor 4y^2 − 20y + 25.",
     "options": ["(2y − 5)^2", "(2y + 5)^2", "(4y − 25)(y − 1)", "(2y − 5)(2y + 5)"],
     "answer": "(2y − 5)^2",
     "explanation": "(2y)^2 − 2·(2y)·5 + 5^2 — perfect square with negative middle term: (2y − 5)^2."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Factor x^3 + 27.",
     "options": ["(x + 3)(x^2 − 3x + 9)", "(x + 3)(x^2 + 3x + 9)", "(x − 3)(x^2 + 3x + 9)", "(x + 3)^3"],
     "answer": "(x + 3)(x^2 − 3x + 9)",
     "explanation": "Sum of cubes: x^3 + 3^3 = (x + 3)(x^2 − 3x + 9)."},

    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-01", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "EVALUATE", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Which of the following equals (a + b)^2 − (a − b)^2?",
     "options": ["0", "2ab", "4ab", "2a^2 + 2b^2"],
     "answer": "4ab",
     "explanation": "(a^2 + 2ab + b^2) − (a^2 − 2ab + b^2) = 4ab."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-02", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "Expand (x + 1/2)(x − 1/2).",
     "options": ["x^2 − 1/2", "x^2 + 1/4", "x^2 − 1/4", "x^2 − x − 1/4"],
     "answer": "x^2 − 1/4",
     "explanation": "x^2 − (1/2)^2 = x^2 − 1/4."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-03", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Expand (y − 5)(y + 8).",
     "options": ["y^2 + 3y − 40", "y^2 − 3y − 40", "y^2 + 13y − 40", "y^2 − 13y − 40"],
     "answer": "y^2 + 3y − 40",
     "explanation": "Sum −5 + 8 = 3, product −5·8 = −40."},
    {"type": "MCQ", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-04", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 2,
     "question": "Expand (x − 2)^3.",
     "options": ["x^3 − 6x^2 + 12x − 8", "x^3 + 6x^2 + 12x + 8", "x^3 − 8", "x^3 − 6x^2 − 12x − 8"],
     "answer": "x^3 − 6x^2 + 12x − 8",
