    {"type": "TRUE_FALSE", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "UNDERSTAND", "marks": 1,
     "question": "To factor x^2 + bx + c with b > 0 and c < 0, we look for two numbers with product c < 0, so they have OPPOSITE signs.",
