     "explanation": "Difference-of-squares identity."},
    {"type": "FILL_BLANK", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-03", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "REMEMBER", "marks": 1,
     "question": "(x + a)(x + b) = x^2 + ____ x + ab.",
     "answer": "(a + b)",
