    {"type": "FILL_BLANK", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-07", "difficulty": "MEDIUM", "cognitive_level": "APPLY", "marks": 1,
     "question": "To factor 3x^2 + 11x + 6 by splitting the middle term, we look for two numbers with sum 11 and product ____.",
     "answer": "18",
     "explanation": "For ax^2 + bx + c, find numbers with sum b and product a·c = 3·6 = 18."},
    {"type": "FILL_BLANK", "outcome_code": "10-NIOS-MATH-SPF-08", "difficulty": "EASY", "cognitive_level": "UNDERSTAND", "marks": 1,
     "question": "x^2 − 2xy + y^2 = (x − y)^____.",
